SUMMARY:Easter Egg Hunt at LEKA Playland\, Ages 0-4 Only
DESCRIPTION:Hop into a fun-filled Easter adventure featuring an egg hunt\, a visit from our non-scary and sweet Easter Bunny\, and plenty of playtime at LEKA Playland. Event is for ages 0–4 only. No exceptions. \n🐰 Event Details\nAges: 0–4 years. Age 4 is the oldest permitted participant for safety reasons. \nPlease plan to arrive on time. Once the egg hunt starts\, eggs are found fast and cannot be re-hidden\, so late arrivals may miss the hunt. \nPrice: $35 per child. Includes 2 free adults per paying child. \nDates: Wednesday\, April 1 | Friday\, April 3 | Saturday\, April 4 \n\nTimes on April 4 only:\n9:00 AM – 10:30 AM\n\n\n11:00 AM – 12:30 PM\n\n\n2:00 PM – 3:30 PM\n\n\n4:00 PM – 5:30 PM
